The upstream LICENSE: bytes that differ from the lock fail; re-locked bytes
whose text is not MPL-2.0 fail on the SPDX id; a missing file fails.
-- ops --
replace rules/brave/LICENSE "Mozilla Public License Version 2.0" "Mozilla Public License Version 2.1"
run Provenance
fail rules/brave/LICENSE: sha256
fail rules/brave/LICENSE: git blob
relock
run Provenance
fail rules/brave/LICENSE: SPDX id NOASSERTION, want MPL-2.0
nofail sha256
rm rules/brave/LICENSE
run Provenance
fail LICENSE: open rules/brave/LICENSE
